      "automatic_live_deployment": false,
      "constraints": "Equity receives30%-70%of invested capital;each style receives15%-35%of equity,retaining prior bounds. Gold and IEF each receive25%-75%of defense,a symmetric half-to-one-and-a-half equal-share constraint fixed before targets/outcomes. Invest98%with2%target idle cash;SPY is only the benchmark and BIL is only available cash implementation,neither enters the risk optimizer.",
